+// Mouse aim for games with a hook that turns the camera itself: the mouse movement (pixels, already scaled by
+// mouse_look and flipped by invert_y) since the previous call. False when mouse_look is off or a menu is open.
+// While a hook keeps calling it (within kMouseAimHold seconds), the pad no longer turns the mouse into right-stick
